            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) When an Employee is paid for travel time under the provisions of Paragraph 3(b), the Company may reduce the Scheduled Daily Tour of such Employee up to the amount of such travel time by varying the starting and stopping time of his or her Scheduled Daily Tour. In such event, the amount of such travel time used in the reduction shall be treated as authorized time worked for purposes of computing overtime compensation for authorized time worked in excess of the Scheduled Daily Tour; also in such event the provisions respecting negotiation contained in Paragraphs 2(c), 2(d), 2(e) of Article 10 shall not apply.",
            "block_bbox": [
